The original full-page browser-agent loop has been removed. This
derivative is a transport-only Chrome extension that hosts Google's
Gemma 4 model in an offscreen document and bridges chrome.runtime
ports from chat.divinci.app to a single shared on-device model
instance.

Portions of this software use:
  - @huggingface/transformers (Apache-2.0)
  - onnxruntime-web (MIT)
  - WXT (MIT)
  - marked (MIT)

Google Gemma 4 model weights are downloaded at runtime from Hugging
Face and are subject to the Gemma Terms of Use
(https://ai.google.dev/gemma/terms).
